# DEPRECATED RAILWAY CONFIGURATION - DO NOT DEPLOY
#
# RAH Midland's backend authority is the verified Echo/FORGE deployment lane.
# This file is retained only to prevent accidental resurrection of the legacy
# Railway configuration. It contains no usable credentials.
#
# Use backend/.env.example for the current variable contract and populate
# production values from the approved secret store.

